1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
Dave M: It's your turn, Mark. Roll the dice.

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:06,300
Mark M: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,880
Dave M: What do you mean?

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:13,940
Mark M: The way he moves the pieces. The way he builds... that long road of his.

5
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:19,230
Dave M: He just placed two wooden sticks on a cardboard hexagon, Mark. Just roll.

6
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:28,820
Mark M: Look at his grip on that Ore card. So dominant. He's cornering the entire mountain region and he doesn't even care who gets hurt. It's feral.

7
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:33,800
Dave M: He's playing a German board game. It's the least feral thing happening in this dorm right now.

8
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,620
Bobby M: I am upgrading my settlement to a city.

9
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:47,570
Mark M: Oh, my god. The infrastructure. The urban density. It's so thick.

10
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,880
Dave M: It's a block of painted pine! Stop looking at him like that!

11
00:00:51,280 --> 00:01:03,990
Mark M: Dave, look at his resource management. He traded three sheep for one brick at a generic port. The raw, masculine confidence to take a three to one loss just to establish dominance on the coastline. It's filthy.

12
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:07,570
Bobby M: I will now play a Knight card. I am moving the Robber.

13
00:01:08,570 --> 00:01:15,690
Mark M: Put it down. Yeah. Block that resource production. Choke his supply chain, you dirty boy.

14
00:01:15,990 --> 00:01:20,360
Dave M: Mark, I'm physically uncomfortable, and Bobby hasn't blinked in four minutes.

15
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:24,500
Bobby M: I demand one resource card from Dave. Blind pull.

16
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:31,870
Mark M: Take it from me instead. Take all my wood, Bobby. Take my wood!

17
00:01:32,470 --> 00:01:37,120
Dave M: You just destroyed the board! That's it. I'm done. I am transferring to a different university.

18
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:42,620
Bobby M: You disrupted my trade route. I am going to dock your victory points.

19
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:47,290
Mark M: Punish me... please.
